  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed boundary railing, by virtue of its location, scale and design, creating a formal terrace at roof level, would appear as an incongruous addition to the host building and out of context with its surroundings. It would fail to remain subordinate to or complement the existing roofscape and therefore, would result in harm to the character and appearance of the host building, the streetscape and the South Hampstead Conservation Area, contrary to policies D1 (Design) and D2 (Heritage) of the London Borough of Camden Local Plan 2017.\r\n"
